    "title": "Severe Thunderstorm Warning by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "2 minutes ago Check NWS updates here\nEffective: 2026-06-10 23:35:00 CDT Expires: 2026-06-11 00:15:00 CDT Urgency: Immediate Severity: Severe Certainty: Observed Instruction: For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a building. Target Area: Harvey, KS At 1135 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located over Newton, moving east at 25 mph.\nHAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and quarter size hail.\nSOURCE...Trained weather spotters reported quarter size hail in Newton at 1134 PM.\nIMPACT...Hail damage to vehicles is expected. Expect wind damage to roofs, siding, and trees.\nLocations impacted include... Newton, North Newton, Whitewater, and Newton Airport.\nThis includes Interstate 135 between Mile Markers 28 and 35.",
